# A Luxel library scene — Apache-2.0. Grammar: library/README.md.
# A weather card fed from outside: slot 0 the temperature ("18C"), slot 1 a
# crawling detail line ("RAIN 80% WIND 12"). The sky is a 1D colour wash
# laid down the rows and ramped to blues. The Rain layer ships HIDDEN (flags
# 0): a loop-tile sprite tiled under the cloud, for an automation to show.
S - Weather Card
L pat 0 0 0 0 normal 100 none fill 1
N Sky
I @pat/color-wash
C sliderScheme 0
C hsvPickerColorA 43691 65536 65536
C hsvPickerColorB 0 0 65536
C sliderMotion 0
C sliderBreathSeconds 1310720
C sliderFloorPercent 4587520
C sliderRepeats 32768
R 100 0:0b2a5b 255:6fb3ef
L sprite 3 10 12 12 normal 100 none tile 0
N Rain
I @spr/rain-tile
L sprite -1 1 0 0 normal 100 none fill 1
N Weather
I @spr/cloud-sun
L text 0 3 0 0 normal 100 black fill 1
N Temperature
T slot 0
F large ffffff r none 0
L text 0 24 0 0 normal 100 black fill 1
N Details
T slot 1
F tiny cfe8ff l left 10
